# Ownership by path (launch-plugin-programme D16): a plugin is the unit of
# installation; a skill folder is the unit of ownership. Later lines win, so
# each skill folder follows its plugin's line.
#
# People on a /plugins/<name>/ line must match that plugin's catalog.yaml
# maintainers (scripts/check-governance.py). The Foundation reviewers own every
# verified plugin; the security reviewers own security-relevant paths. GitHub
# asks each listed owner for review; the required-reviews workflow enforces an
# approval from every group (design D9).

